# 🔐 Security Features

Face ID systems include protections against:

- Photos
- Videos
- Printed images
- Masks (depending on implementation)
- Spoofing attacks

Additional technologies may include:

- Depth sensing
- Liveness detection
- Infrared verification
- Attention awareness

