# 📊 Typical Recognition Pipeline

```text
Face Detected
      ↓
Facial Landmark Detection
      ↓
Feature Extraction (CNN)
      ↓
Face Embedding Generation
      ↓
Cosine Similarity Comparison
      ↓
Authentication Decision
      ↓
Unlock Device
```

---

# 🎯 Interview Answer

> Face ID converts facial geometry into high-dimensional embeddings using deep learning models such as Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs). During authentication, the generated embedding is compared with the stored embedding using similarity metrics like cosine similarity. Infrared cameras and depth sensors allow accurate recognition even in low-light or complete darkness.

